Word Study
(sounds to words)
EN2PWS-I-1 Identify Grade 2 level-appropriate sight words. L S R W*
EN2PWS-I-2 Identify alphabet letter names. L S R W*
EN2PWS-I-3 Read words accurately and automatically according to word 
patterns (initial, final, medial): CVC words L S R W*
