MATATAG Curriculum: English (Grades 2-10) August 2023
61
GRADE 3
GRADE LEVEL STANDARD
The learners demonstrate basic literacy in English, with L1 as a literacy resource; expand their vocabulary for conversational 
use and content learning, using high frequency and content-specific words; use simple and compound sentences to get and 
express meaning; and comprehend, analyze, create, and compose developmentally-appropriate and content-specific texts.
QUARTER 1
CONTENT 
STANDARDS
The learners demonstrate expanding vocabulary and understanding of high frequency words and content-specific 
vocabulary; understand and create simple and compound sentences for comprehending, analyzing, creating, and 
composing texts about regional themes and content-specific topics.
PERFORMANCE 
STANDARDS
The learners use their expanding vocabulary of high-frequency and content-specific words, and simple and compound 
sentences to comprehend, create, and compose narrative and informational texts about regional themes and contentspecific topics; and read grade level texts with appropriate speed, accuracy, and expression.
