TRANSACTIONAL TEXT: LETTER OF APPLICATION
Evaluating letters for clarity of purpose and meaning
EN10TRAN-III-1 Analyze distinguishing features of informal and formal correspondences to infer 
sender’s meaning and purpose across modalities: letter of application.

